    {
      "id": "msg_0047_D01R0101_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "A bunch of DIGLETT popped out of the\n",
        "ground! That was surprising!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0047_D01R0101_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "Brock: Small spaces surrounded by\n",
        "rocks make you feel peaceful,\f",
        "don’t you agree?\r",
        "By the way, do you want to\n",
        "exchange numbers? {YESNO 0}\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0047_D01R0101_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} registered Brock\n",
        "in the Pokégear!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0047_D01R0101_00003",
      "en_US": [
        "Brock: I would love to have a Pokémon\n",
        "battle against you!\f",
        "Give me a call on Saturday nights!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0047_D01R0101_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "Brock: I see... How disappointing.\n",
        "I would love to have a Pokémon battle\f",
        "against you..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0047_D01R0101_00005",
      "en_US": "Brock: Can we exchange numbers? {YESNO 0}"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0047_D01R0101_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "Brock: Hey, you! Why don’t you\n",
        "take a picture with me? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0047_D01R0101_00007",
      "en_US": [
        "Brock: All righty!\n",
        "Stand next to me and relax!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0047_D01R0101_00008",
      "en_US": [
        "Brock: Yes!\n",
        "Another great memory!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0047_D01R0101_00009",
      "en_US": [
        "Brock: Well...\n",
        "That’s OK."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0047_D01R0101_00010",
      "en_US": [
        "Your Photo Album is full.\r",
        "Access your PC and delete\n",
        "some pictures."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0047_D01R0101_00011",
      "en_US": [
        "Brock: Hi, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\n",
        "Have you seen a Pokémon called BONSLY?\r",
        "They say you have to get it from\n",
        "an Egg...\r",
        "I am having a hard time finding one.\n",
        "If you happen to have a BONSLY,\f",
        "could you trade it for my RHYHORN? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0047_D01R0101_00012",
      "en_US": [
        "Brock: Hi, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\n",
        "Have you seen a Pokémon called BONSLY?\r",
        "They say you have to get it from an\n",
        "Egg...\r",
        "I am having a hard time finding one.\n",
        "If you happen to have a BONSLY,\f",
        "could you trade it for my RHYHORN? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0047_D01R0101_00013",
      "en_US": [
        "Brock: All right!\n",
        "Let’s trade!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0047_D01R0101_00014",
      "en_US": [
        "Brock: I thought you might have one,\n",
        "but I guess it’s not that easy...\r",
        "If you find one, remember to trade\n",
        "with me, OK?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0047_D01R0101_00015",
      "en_US": [
        "Brock: I am looking for BONSLY.\n",
        "Are you saying you’ll trade\f",
        "it for my RHYHORN? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0047_D01R0101_00016",
      "en_US": [
        "Brock: Thank you!\n",
        "I have been looking for BONSLY!\r",
        "The RHYHORN I gave you knows the move\n",
        "Thunder Fang! I trained it from an Egg.\r",
        "I’m so proud of it, because it can\n",
        "take down Water-type Pokémon, which\f",
        "usually are a tough matchup.\r",
        "Take good care of it for me!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0047_D01R0101_00017",
      "en_US": [
        "Brock: That RHYHORN I gave you knows\n",
        "Thunder Fang! I trained it from an Egg.\r",
        "I’m so proud of it, because it can\n",
        "take down Water-type Pokémon, which\f",
        "usually are a tough matchup.\r",
        "Take good care of it for me!\n",
        "\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0047_D01R0101_00018",
      "en_US": [
        "Brock: Hey, now!\n",
        "That is not a BONSLY!"
      ]
    }
  ]
